menu "Now Playing"

    config NP_BOARD_M5DIAL
        bool "Build for the M5Stack Dial (ESP32-S3 StampS3, GC9A01 240x240)"
        default n
        help
            The Dial shares the esp32s3 target with the Waveshare board but
            has a different panel, no PSRAM, and a rotary encoder. Normally
            selected by sdkconfig.defaults.m5dial rather than by hand.

endmenu
